e","data:image/jpeg;base64,","https://cdn.sanity.io/images/f0yvhrzy/production/978a4fe8f9eed32136e9f657e28f1ad624426870-1000x667.jpg","Bedroom opening to a timber deck through sliding doors, Brunswick Transformation, Brunswick","data:image/jpeg;base64,","https://cdn.sanity.io/images/f0yvhrzy/production/b1eeed3476c888844428d35f959a9d5b3c500abb-1000x667.jpg","Open-plan dining and kitchen with the staircase beyond, Brunswick Transformation, Melbourne","data:image/jpeg;base64,","https://cdn.sanity.io/images/f0yvhrzy/production/d7473315af4b8913a5435661d53b038d2cd3c5b4-1000x667.jpg","Dining area with timber table, black chairs and a wall mirror, Brunswick Transformation, Brunswick","data:image/jpeg;base64,","https://cdn.sanity.io/images/f0yvhrzy/production/42252b6cd48ce4d0f5820e9267356e3911c68029-1000x667.jpg","Kitchen with stone island, dark timber cabinetry and plantation shutters, Brunswick Transformation, Melbourne","data:image/jpeg;base64,","https://cdn.sanity.io/images/f0yvhrzy/production/1a5f90f9041df523431741fd028ae05929a4cf82-1000x667.jpg","Sitting room with a cream chaise and grey armchairs beneath a ceiling rose, Brunswick Transformation, Melbourne","data:image/jpeg;base64,","https://cdn.sanity.io/images/f0yvhrzy/production/2a89f295145b65ba6f4e48b04f31ff8559e4f795-1000x667.jpg","Living room with a grey corner sofa, ceiling rose and sheer curtains, Brunswick Transformation, Brunswick","data:image/jpeg;base64,","https://cdn.sanity.io/images/f0yvhrzy/production/367ca7236d86c1ddcd32a250ec5c09d7c6860a37-1000x667.jpg","Retained 1970s double-storey brown-brick facade with arched garage and wrought-iron balcony, Brunswick Transformation, Melbourne","data:image/jpeg;base64,","Renovation","client","Private Residence","duration","6 months","Brunswick, VIC","size","150 sqm","2019",{"_234":376,"_236":237,"_238":377,"_244":378,"_246":379},{"_234":370,"_236":237,"_238":371,"_244":372,"_246":247},{"_234":364,"_236":237,"_238":365,"_244":366,"_246":247},{"_234":358,"_236":237,"